UPDATE companies SET description='SATMED Health LLC operates dual headquarters in New York, New York, and Hong Kong SAR, with global design hubs in the United States and Australia. The company was founded on a commitment to precision and clinical excellence in radiology consumables and medical imaging solutions, led by CEO and CFO Carol Si.

As a OEM and ODM manufacturer, SATMED Health produces contrast media delivery systems, CT/MRI/interventional injectors, radiology drapes, and multi-use syringe systems under brands such as SATDrape, SATPro, SATSyringe, and SATLine. Manufacturing occurs across CE-, FDA-, and ISO-accredited factories in Shenzhen, Zhuhai, Shanghai, and Wuhan, utilizing automated sterile production lines for high-capacity output. The direct-to-factory model eliminates intermediaries, offering custom medical manufacturing and high-volume wholesale orders supported by global land, air, and sea logistics.

The company serves radiology, cardiology, and interventional medicine departments in hospitals worldwide, including specialized support for developing nations. Its portfolio targets clinical workflows in diagnostic imaging and interventional procedures, with products designed to optimize hospital procurement and patient safety.

SATMED Health differentiates itself through a sustainability focus—claiming 80% plastic reduction via multi-use syringe systems—and a turnkey support model spanning market analysis, clinical education, and technical support. The firm leverages over 30 years of collective experience in radiology and cardiology among its advisory board of physicians and medical physics experts.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','CE','FDA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["OEM manufacturing", "ODM manufacturing", "Sterile manufacturing", "Automated production line assembly", "Contrast media delivery system design", "Radiology consumable production", "Custom medical manufacturing", "High-volume wholesale production", "Global logistics and supply chain management", "Clinical education and technical support", "Market analysis"], "industries": ["Radiology", "Cardiology", "Interventional medicine", "Medical imaging", "Healthcare"], "materials": ["Medical-grade plastics", "Eco-conscious materials"], "equipment": ["Automated sterile production lines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Direct-to-factory OEM/ODM manufacturing model", "80% plastic reduction via multi-use syringe systems", "CE, FDA, and ISO-accredited factories in China", "Global design hubs in USA and Australia", "Turnkey support from market analysis to clinical education", "Automated sterile production lines"], "facts_used": ["Dual headquarters in New York and Hong Kong -> /about-us", "Global design hubs in USA and Australia -> /about-us", "CEO/CFO Carol Si named -> /about-us", "OEM/ODM manufacturer, direct-to-factory model -> /about-us", "Products: contrast media delivery systems, injectors, drapes, syringes, branded lines -> /about-us", "Factories in Shenzhen, Zhuhai, Shanghai, Wuhan with CE/FDA/ISO accreditation -> /about-us", "Automated sterile production lines -> /about-us", "Global logistics across land, air, sea -> /about-us", "Industries: radiology, cardiology, interventional medicine -