UPDATE companies SET description='Schwan''s Pizza Plant, operating as part of CJ Schwan''s, is headquartered in Salina, Kansas. Originally established as a Minnesota dairy operation in the 1950s, the business was incorporated as Schwan''s Sales Enterprises, Inc., and has since evolved into a large-scale U.S.-based food manufacturer.

Today the company produces a wide range of frozen and prepared foods for retail grocery, K-12 school nutrition programs, restaurants, healthcare facilities, convenience stores, and college and university dining halls. With approximately 9,000 employees and multiple production facilities across the country, the operation focuses on culinary innovation, ingredient quality, and food safety to supply both branded and private-label products.

Its customer base spans the foodservice and retail channels, including school districts, hospital systems, restaurant operators, and convenience-store distributors. The company''s portfolio includes family-favorite brands that are distributed internationally through its affiliation with CJ Foods, a global food conglomerate.

The business emphasizes carefully selected ingredients and rigorous food-safety standards as its core differentiators, aiming to create a world of flavors for every table through consistent quality and innovation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Food manufacturing", "Frozen food production", "Prepared food production", "Private-label manufacturing", "Branded product manufacturing"], "industries": ["Retail grocery", "K-12 education", "Restaurant and foodservice", "Healthcare", "Convenience stores", "College and university dining", "Food manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Culinary innovation and food-safety focus", "Portfolio of trusted brands for retail and foodservice", "U.S.-based affiliate of CJ Foods", "Serves retail, K-12, restaurant, healthcare, convenience, and college dining", "Multiple production facilities nationwide"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Salina, Kansas -> db", "Founded in 1948 -> db", "9,000 employees -> db", "Founded by Marvin and Alfred Schwan, with Robert Schwan joining in 1948 -> description", "Incorporated as Schwan''s Sales Enterprises, Inc. -> description", "Started as Minnesota dairy in 1950s -> /about-us", "Leading U.S.-based food manufacturer -> /about-us", "Produces foods for retail, K-12 schools, restaurants, healthcare, convenience stores, college dining -> /about-us", "Affiliate of CJ Foods -> /about-us", "Focus on carefully selected ingredients, culinary innovation, food safety -> /about-us", "Portfolio of trusted brands enjoyed internationally -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "we''ve grown to become a leading U.S.-based food manufacturer", "founded_year": "1948", "employee_count": "9000", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='schwan-s-pizza-plant' 