 knitting machines, 168-210 inch width, 24-36 gauge -> page /capabilities", "4 tricot warpers, denier range 15/1 to 300 -> page /capabilities", "Materials: nylon, polyester, textured/flat yarn, low-melt polyester, polypropylene -> page /capabilities", "Industries: automotive, medical, filtration, military, protective apparel, hook-and-loop, apparel -> db, page /capabilities"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Shawmut Infinite is a platform for the world''s most advanced warping and warp knitting operation for automotive interior and other industrial fabrics.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='shawmut-infinite' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Shearer''s Foods, headquartered in Phoenix, Arizona, was founded in 2012. The company operates as a private brand and co-manufacturer of snack foods across North America.

The company runs 16 plants with more than 100 production lines, including three Canadian facilities operating under the Super-Pufft name. Its manufacturing footprint covers salty snacks, cookies, and crackers, with specialized capabilities in single- and twin-screw extrusion, baked crisp production using milk protein, and peanut butter wafer bars, protein bars, and crème wafers at its Guelph, Ontario plant. Shearer''s offers both private brand partnerships—developing products under retailer labels—and co-manufacturing services for national brands.

Shearer''s serves retailers seeking private label snacks and national brands requiring contract manufacturing capacity. Its customer base spans the salty snack, cookie, and cracker categories, with the company noting it is the largest private brand salty snack supplier and second-largest private brand cookie and cracker supplier in North America.

