UPDATE companies SET description='Shore Metal Fabricators LLC was founded in 2019 in Clayton, Delaware, as a family-owned and operated business. The company traces its roots to over 30 years of hands-on metal fabrication experience, combining that legacy with modern technology to serve the Mid-Atlantic region.

The company specializes in professional gutter installation, standing seam roofing systems, and custom HVAC ductwork fabrication. Using in-house roll forming equipment, they produce seamless gutters and precision HVAC components tailored to each property. They handle both residential and commercial projects across Delaware and Eastern Maryland, offering custom accessories and large-scale installations.

The firm focuses on the specific environmental demands of the Mid-Atlantic coast, such as heavy rain and seasonal temperature shifts.

The firm differentiates itself through its family-owned structure, three decades of fabrication expertise, in-house roll forming capabilities, and rare ES-1 and GT-1 certifications for gutter and perimeter edge systems that meet International Building Code wind resistance requirements. They also highlight local accountability and recognition as a Top 3 Gutter Company in Central Delaware for 2025.', certifications=ARRAY['ES-1','GT-1']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Gutter installation", "Standing seam roofing systems", "HVAC ductwork fabrication", "Custom metal fabrication", "In-house roll forming", "Seamless gutter production", "ES-1 certified perimeter edge systems", "GT-1 certified gutter systems", "Residential and commercial installation", "Custom accessories fabrication"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "HVAC", "Roofing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated with over 30 years of fabrication experience", "In-house roll forming for custom seamless gutters and HVAC components", "ES-1 and GT-1 certified gutter and perimeter edge systems", "Recognized as a Top 3 Gutter Company in Central Delaware (2025)", "Local service across Delaware and Eastern Maryland"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2019 -> db, /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /, /about-us", "Over 30 years of hands-on fabrication experience -> /, /about-us", "Headquartered in Clayton, Delaware -> db", "Services: gutter installation, standing seam roofing, HVAC ductwork fabrication -> /", "In-house roll forming technology -> /, /about-us", "ES-1 and GT-1 certifications -> /, /about-us", "Residential and commercial projects -> /", "Serves Delaware and Eastern Maryland -> /, /about-us", "Top 3 Gutter Company 2025 -> /", "First State Favorites award -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "By utilizing our in-house roll forming t