UPDATE companies SET description='The U.S. entity operates as a subsidiary of the global Siemens AG, employing over 1,000 people across its American operations. The company combines global standards with local market expertise, maintaining manufacturing facilities and innovation hubs across Europe, the Americas, Asia‑Pacific, and the Middle East.

