UPDATE companies SET description='Sierra Communications, LLC was founded in 1991 in Bangor, Maine. The company is family-owned, a detail noted by a client who reported that one of the family owners presented their services during the evaluation process. From its start, the firm has focused on telephone and IT support for small and medium-sized businesses across central and southern Maine, including the Bangor, Augusta, Lewiston-Auburn, Brunswick, and Portland areas.

The company delivers a suite of managed technology services: 24/7/365 monitoring and maintenance of devices, servers, and networks; business continuity and disaster recovery planning; VoIP telephone systems; cloud services for remote data access; and security services targeting malware, viruses, and ransomware. It also provides IT consulting, network support, and infrastructure management. Operations run from three locations — the Bangor headquarters, a Central Maine office in Winthrop, and a Raleigh, North Carolina office — though headcount and facility size are not disclosed.

Sierra serves small and medium businesses in Maine and beyond. Reference clients include Canteen Service Co., a food-service operator; Arnold Memorial Hospital, a healthcare provider; and MSAD #63, a school district. The firm emphasizes customized technology solutions to increase productivity and reduce risk for each customer.

The company states that its proactive monitoring approach secures revenue through business continuity, claiming that clients experience 99.99% uptime. It differentiates itself with round-the-clock support, personalized account management, and a focus on making communications and IT a streamlined part of operations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Managed IT Services", "Business Continuity Planning", "VoIP Telephone Systems", "Cloud Services", "Security Services (malware, ransomware protection)", "IT Consulting", "Network Support", "Infrastructure Management", "Cloud Integration"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Education", "Food Service", "Small and medium businesses"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7/365 monitoring and maintenance of devices, servers, and networks", "99.99% uptime for clients", "Proactive business continuity and disaster recovery planning", "Family-owned with personalized account management", "Multi-state presence in Maine and North Carolina"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1991 -> db", "Headquarters Bangor, Maine -> /", "Family-owned -> / (testimonial from Michael Willey)", "Services: Managed IT, Business Continuity, VoIP, Cloud, Security, IT Consulting, Network Support, Infrastructure Management -> /services", "Clients: Canteen Service Co., Arnold Memorial Hospital, MSAD #63 -> /", "Locations: Bangor (HQ), Winthrop (Central Maine), Raleigh, NC -> /", "99.99% uptime claim -> /", "24/7/365 monitoring -> /services", "Proactive monitoring for business continuity -> /", "Customized technology solutions -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Since 1991, Sierra Communications & Technologies has been a leading provider of Telephone and IT support and consulting", "founded_year": "1991", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "