UPDATE companies SET description='SourceEazy was founded in 2020 in Des Moines, Iowa, by Russel Karim, who serves as CEO. Born in Dhaka, Bangladesh, Karim grew up amid the garment industry and later moved to the United States, where he built and exited two technology ventures. That background inspired him to create a platform that would bring software-driven efficiency to the promotional and uniform supply chain.

The company operates an AI-powered sourcing platform that connects distributors, decorators, and brands with a global network of verified manufacturers. Its suite includes a design studio, an automated catalog builder, a merch-store front end, and tools for order management, inventory tracking, and fulfillment. The platform aggregates products from suppliers in Bangladesh, Pakistan, India, Guatemala, Mexico, China, Vietnam, and domestic U.S. sources, offering access to more than 500 print-on-demand items without requiring users to hold inventory.

SourceEazy serves promotional-product distributors, uniform suppliers, corporate-gifting programs, and digital creators who launch branded merch stores. Customers include businesses such as Swag365, Global Swagger, and Merchpath, which use the platform to streamline quoting, sampling, and production tracking. The company reports more than 100 clients worldwide, with team members based in Des Moines and Dhaka providing on-the-ground oversight.

Karim started SourceEazy to remove the layers of intermediaries that complicate sourcing and to advocate for sustainable, compliant manufacturing. The platform screens factories for labor and environmental standards, and its search engine filters suppliers by product type and volume. By automating design-to-delivery workflows, the company aims to let distributors focus on sales rather than supply-chain logistics.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["AI-powered sourcing", "Design Studio", "ProofEazy proofing and catalog technology", "AI Catalog Builder", "MerchStore e-commerce and fulfillment automation", "Automated ordering and inventory control", "Order fulfillment and shipment tracking", "Team collaboration tools", "Customizable products with embellishments and private labeling", "Phygital solutions", "Eco-friendly product options", "Request for Quote (RFQ) management", "Request for Sample management", "Supplier verification and compliance screening", "Automated factory-direct sourcing", "Print-on-demand (500+ products)", "Rewards and points-based programs", "Integration with websites, social media, and marketplaces", "Branded merch site creation", "Personalized sales proposals", "Custom catalog generation", "Company swag store setup", "Fundraising site creation", "Global sourcing from Bangladesh, Pakistan, India, Guatemala, Mexico, China, Vietnam", "Domestic U.S. sourcing", "Uniform sourcing", "Corporate gifting programs", "Swag bulk ordering", "Supply chain management"], "industries": ["Promotional products", "Uniforms", "Event merchandise", "Corporate gifting", "Sports & fitness apparel", "Streetwear", "Golf apparel", "College fan merchandise", "Employee recognition", "Eco-friendly apparel"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free marketplace signup for both distributors and manufacturers", "AI-powered search that filters verified manufacturers by product and volume", "Real-